### North star — the most beautiful OS

RoboticelaOS must feel **Apple-class**: calm, precise, typographically excellent. Beauty is not a late polish pass — it is a **first-class product constraint** on every phase after 11.

**Why text looks bad today (fix this first):** Phase 5 can *load* fonts, but paint still draws **one outline per code point** with no shaping, no kerning/ligatures, and weak coverage/antialiasing. Inter is a single baked face used as a stopgap. Until shaped glyph runs + quality raster + a real typeface pack land, the desktop cannot look premium.

**Beauty bar (every UI surface must pass):**
- Type: correct metrics, AA coverage, kerning/ligatures for Latin first, then world scripts
- Colour: design tokens only (`Documentation/Development/ColorPalette.md` + Apple design rule)
- Layout: generous whitespace, one hero idea per surface, deference to content
- Motion: restrained easing; no noise
- Chrome: panel, windows, and wallpaper read as materials, not rectangles

