## Final target

The completed architecture should ultimately be:

```text
                    ROBOTICELAOS
                         │
                ROBOTICELA RUNTIME
                         │
       ┌─────────────────┼──────────────────┐
       │                 │                  │
   Web/UI Runtime   Application Runtime   Native Runtime
       │                 │                  │
 HTML/CSS/DOM/JS      Prisma/Postgres      OS APIs
 Fonts/Text           Backend JS           Filesystem
 Layout/Paint         RPC/API              Processes
 Graphics             Jobs                 Hardware
 Compositor           Services             Devices
       │                 │                  │
       └─────────────────┼──────────────────┘
                         │
                  Roboticela APIs
```

And the final application developer experience is essentially:

```text
HTML + CSS + JavaScript
          │
          ├── UI (beautiful by default)
          ├── PostgreSQL via Prisma
          ├── Files
          ├── Backend
          ├── Network
          ├── Processes
          ├── Hardware
          ├── Graphics
          ├── Audio/Video
          ├── OS services
          ├── Windows
          ├── Devices
          ├── Authentication
          ├── Jobs
          └── Native OS operations
```

**Product promise:** users build web applications *and* live in an OS whose type, chrome, and motion feel first-class — typography and beauty are completed early (Phase 12–15), not bolted on at the end.
